---@field timeMax? string The end of the interval.
---@field timeMin? string The start of the interval.
---@field groups? gcp.calendar_v3.FreeBusyGroupMap Expansion of groups.

---@class gcp.calendar_v3.GetAclRequest
---@field ruleId string ACL rule identifier.
---@field calendarId string Calendar identifier. To retrieve calendar IDs call the calendarList.list method. If you want to access the primary calendar of the currently logged in user, use the "primary" keyword.

---@class gcp.calendar_v3.GetCalendarListRequest
---@field calendarId string Calendar identifier. To retrieve calendar IDs call the calendarList.list method. If you want to access the primary calendar of the currently logged in user, use the "primary" keyword.

